        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 21:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Now the Lamanites of themselves were sufficiently hardened, but the Amalekites and the Amulonites were still harder; therefore they did cause the Lamanites that they should harden their hearts, that they should wax strong in wickedness and their abominations.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
