        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Now Aaron began to open the scriptures unto them concerning the coming of Christ, and also concerning the resurrection of the dead, and that there could be no redemption for mankind save it were through the death and sufferings of Christ, and the atonement of his blood.",
